OL,3,GNEWSAWhat to expect at Liverpool
OL,4,AChristmas Market in 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith just weeks to go until Liverpool's
OL,7,FChristmas Market opens for another
OL,8,Ffestive season we look at what you can
OL,9,Fexpect this year.
OL,11,FA new outdoor ice-skating rink is
OL,12,Fplanned for St George's Plateau,
OL,13,Fdirectly opposite Lime Street Station.
OL,15,FThe traditional Christmas market will
OL,16,Ffeature local traders alongside other
OL,17,Fattractions including a giant Ferris
OL,18,Fwheel, vintage carousel, snow slide,
OL,19,FSanta Land and a range of bars.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
